    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this three bedroom mid terraced property in the residential area of St Patrick's Park, located within a short walk of the town centre of Carrick on Shannon. Accommodation comprises of entrance hall, sitting room with electric stove, kitchen/diner with a range of wall and base cupboards, shower room and storage area. Stairs leads to three bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and attic space. The property benefits from a large rear garden with two sheds and off street parking to the front of the property.  Benefits include: new front door & windows, new boiler and large rear garden. This property is within walking distance of all town centre amenities such as schools, shops, restaurants, leisure centre and beautiful walks/parks along the River Shannon and Carrick on Shannon train station which serves the Dublin/Sligo line daily. Ideal starter home. For all viewings on this lovely house please contact Gallagher Auctioneers Ltd."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 4.57m (15'0\") x 1.83m (6'0\")\r\n\r\nSitting Room 2.96m (9'9\") x 4.66m (15'3\")\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner 4.47m (14'8\") x 2.7m (8'10\")\r\n\r\nShower Room 1.73m (5'8\") x 2.61m (8'7\")\r\n\r\nStorage Area 4.1m (13'5\") x 0.85m (2'9\")\r\n\r\nFirst Floor \r\n\r\nBedroom One 3.99m (13'1\") x 3.26m (10'8\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 2.3m (7'7\") x 3.27m (10'9\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Three 2.52m (8'3\") x 2.14m (7'0\")\r\n\r\nAttic Space 3.86m (12'8\") x 2.07m (6'9\")"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three bedroom mid terraced property \r\n\r\nLocated within a short walk of the town centre\r\n\r\nLarge rear garden with two sheds\r\n\r\nOff street parking to the front of the property \r\n\r\nNew front door & windows\r\n\r\nNew boiler"
